# No line-ending conversion anywhere: the generators and checkers depend on
# files being byte-exact (ps4.asm is LF, some tools are CRLF, and
# examinecredits.py splits on the exact terminator). Binaries marked so diffs
# stay readable.
* -text
*.bin binary
*.state binary
*.exs binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.nem binary
